      "en": "**Chat memory** keeps the last messages of a conversation (e.g. the last 10) so the agent understands «that one» and «as I told you». Simple Memory is lost when n8n restarts; in production use Postgres or Redis Chat Memory. The **session key** (phone number or chat id) separates each customer."
